{"sha": "5242bfc930c4b26183ea279db29532fe1c1ce3941c96afcf855546aa70e94a31", "body": ["\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:comparison:6}", "精确关系：$\\cot y_n = x_n = n\\pi + \\frac\\pi2 - y_n$，其中 $y_n", "\\sim \\frac{1}{n\\pi}$（见\\cref{ex:b2:comparison:tan}）。展开 $\\cot y", "= \\frac1y - \\frac y3 + O(y^3)$:", "\\[", "\\frac{1}{y_n} - \\frac{y_n}{3} + O(y_n^3) = n\\pi + \\frac\\pi2 - y_n", "\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad", "\\frac{1}{y_n} = n\\pi + \\frac\\pi2 + O\\Bigl(\\frac1n\\Bigr),", "\\]", "（其中 $-y_n$ 与 $-\\frac{y_n}{3}$ 均为 $O(\\frac1n)$）。取倒数：", "\\[", "y_n = \\frac{1}{n\\pi}\\cdot\\frac{1}{1 + \\frac{1}{2n} + O(n^{-2})}", "= \\frac{1}{n\\pi}\\Bigl(1 - \\frac{1}{2n} + O\\Bigl(\\frac{1}{n^2}\\Bigr)\\Bigr)", "= \\frac{1}{n\\pi} - \\frac{1}{2n^2\\pi} + O\\Bigl(\\frac{1}{n^3}\\Bigr).", "\\]", "由此", "\\[", "x_n = n\\pi + \\frac{\\pi}{2} - y_n", "= n\\pi + \\frac\\pi2 - \\frac{1}{n\\pi} + \\frac{1}{2n^2\\pi} +", "o\\Bigl(\\frac{1}{n^2}\\Bigr).", "\\]", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:comparison:7}", "分出最大的两项：", "\\[", "\\sum_{k=0}^{n} k! = n! + (n-1)! + \\sum_{k \\leq n-2} k! ,", "\\qquad", "\\sum_{k\\leq n-2} k! \\leq (n-1)\\,(n-2)! = (n-1)! .", "\\]", "故 $1 \\leq \\frac{1}{n!}\\sum k! \\leq 1 + \\frac{2}{n}$，极限为", "$1$。精细化：$\\frac{(n-1)!}{n!} = \\frac1n$，粗略的界", "$\\sum_{k \\leq n-2}k! \\leq (n-1)!$ 可用同样方式加细：", "$\\sum_{k\\leq n-2} k! = (n-2)!\\,(1 + O(\\frac1n)) = O\\bigl(\\frac{n!}{n^2}\\bigr)$.", "由此", "\\[", "\\sum_{k=0}^{n} k! = n!\\Bigl(1 + \\frac1n + O\\Bigl(\\frac{1}{n^2}\\Bigr)\\Bigr).", "\\]", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:comparison:8}", "$(u_n)$ 递增；若它有界，则将收敛到 $\\ell$，且", "$\\ell = \\ell + \\frac1\\ell$，矛盾。故 $u_n \\to \\infty$。", "", "取平方：$u_{n+1}^2 = u_n^2 + 2 + u_n^{-2}$，于是", "\\[", "u_n^2 = u_0^2 + 2n + \\sum_{k=0}^{n-1} \\frac{1}{u_k^2} .", "\\]", "和式为 $o(n)$（各项趋于 $0$，由切萨罗平均），故 $u_n^2 \\sim 2n$", "且 $u_n \\sim \\sqrt{2n}$。", "", "精细化：$\\frac{1}{u_k^2} \\sim \\frac{1}{2k}$，于是由比较", "（见\\cref{thm:b2:comparison:seriesintegral}，或", "正项级数部分和的等价量）$\\sum_{k<n} u_k^{-2} \\sim \\frac12 \\ln n$。", "由此", "\\[", "u_n^2 = 2n + \\frac{\\ln n}{2}\\,(1 + o(1)) + O(1)", "\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad", "u_n = \\sqrt{2n}\\sqrt{1 + \\frac{\\ln n}{4n} + o\\Bigl(\\frac{\\ln", "n}{n}\\Bigr)}", "= \\sqrt{2n}\\Bigl(1 + \\frac{\\ln n}{8n} + o\\Bigl(\\frac{\\ln", "n}{n}\\Bigr)\\Bigr).", "\\]", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:comparison:9}", "提出 $n$，并令 $t = \\ln n$：", "\\[", "S_n = \\frac1n \\sum_{k=1}^{n} \\frac{1}{1 + t\\,\\frac kn} .", "\\]", "固定 $t$ 时，和式是函数 $u \\mapsto \\frac{1}{1 +", "tu}$ 在 $\\intcc{0}{1}$ 上的黎曼和；该函数关于 $u$ 单调，故", "其黎曼和被相差一个步长的积分夹住：", "\\[", "\\int_0^1 \\frac{\\dd u}{1 + tu} - \\frac1n", "\\leq S_n \\leq \\int_0^1 \\frac{\\dd u}{1 + tu} + \\frac1n", "\\]", "（单调函数的黎曼和与其积分的比较，", "对每个 $n$ 以各自的 $t = \\ln n$ 成立）。现有", "$\\int_0^1 \\frac{\\dd u}{1 + tu} = \\frac{\\ln(1 + t)}{t}$，且", "$\\frac1n = o\\bigl(\\frac{\\ln t}{t}\\bigr)$，因此", "\\[", "S_n = \\frac{\\ln(1 + \\ln n)}{\\ln n} + O\\Bigl(\\frac 1n\\Bigr)", "\\;\\sim\\; \\frac{\\ln\\ln n}{\\ln n} .", "\\]", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:comparison:10}", "恒等式：$(\\ln n)^{\\ln n} = \\eu^{\\ln n\\,\\ln\\ln n} =", "\\bigl(\\eu^{\\ln n}\\bigr)^{\\ln\\ln n} = n^{\\ln\\ln n}$。排序：", "比较对数。$\\ln(n^2) = 2\\ln n$；$\\ln\\bigl((\\ln", "n)^{\\ln n}\\bigr) = \\ln n\\ln\\ln n$; $\\ln(2^n) = n\\ln2$;", "$\\ln(n!) = n\\ln n - n + O(\\ln n)$（斯特林公式，或较粗糙的", "夹逼 $\\ln n! \\sim n\\ln n$）；$\\ln(n^n) = n\\ln n$。由于", "$2\\ln n = o(\\ln n\\ln\\ln n)$, $\\ln n\\ln\\ln n = o(n)$, $n\\ln 2 =", "o(n\\ln n - n)$，且 $n \\ln n - n \\sim n\\ln n$，但 $n! / n^n \\to", "0$（对数之差为 $-n + O(\\ln n) \\to -\\infty$）：", "\\[", "n^2 = o\\bigl((\\ln n)^{\\ln n}\\bigr),\\quad", "(\\ln n)^{\\ln n} = o(2^n),\\quad", "2^n = o(n!),\\quad", "n! = o(n^n).", "\\]", "（对每一步：对数之差趋于", "$+\\infty$，于是比值趋于 $0$）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:comparison:11}", "将 $\\frac1{k^2} = \\frac1{k(k+1)} + \\frac1{k^2(k+1)}$ 分解，并", "对 $k > n$ 求和：", "\\[", "\\sum_{k>n}\\frac1{k^2} = \\frac1{n+1} +", "\\sum_{k>n}\\frac{1}{k^2(k+1)} ,", "\\]", "第一个和式恰好裂项相消（$\\frac1{k(k+1)} = \\frac1k -", "\\frac1{k+1}$）。对第二个和式：$\\frac{1}{k^2(k+1)} = \\frac1{k^3}", "+ O\\bigl(\\frac1{k^4}\\bigr)$（因为 $\\frac{1}{k^2(k+1)} -", "\\frac1{k^3} = \\frac{-1}{k^3(k+1)}$），并由", "积分比较，$\\sum_{k>n}\\frac1{k^3} = \\frac1{2n^2} +", "O\\bigl(\\frac1{n^3}\\bigr)$, $\\sum_{k>n}\\frac1{k^4} =", "O\\bigl(\\frac1{n^3}\\bigr)$。由此", "\\[", "\\sum_{k>n}\\frac1{k^2}", "= \\frac1{n+1} + \\frac{1}{2n^2} + O\\Bigl(\\frac1{n^3}\\Bigr)", "= \\frac1n - \\frac1{n^2} + \\frac{1}{2n^2} +", "O\\Bigl(\\frac1{n^3}\\Bigr)", "= \\frac1n - \\frac{1}{2n^2} + O\\Bigl(\\frac1{n^3}\\Bigr),", "\\]", "利用 $\\frac1{n+1} = \\frac1n - \\frac1{n^2} +", "O\\bigl(\\frac1{n^3}\\bigr)$.", "\\end{solution}", ""]}